Update:

README.md
PROJECT_SPEC.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT.md

with a concise product identity statement:

This application is a local-first spatial translation layer for Windows. It observes content already visible on the user’s display, performs OCR and translation locally, and renders the translation as a spatial overlay while minimizing persistent reproduction of the underlying content.

Do not describe the product as:

